      "text": "We can approximate the product as \\[ \\begin{align*} (3 \\cdot 10^{-4})(8 \\cdot 10^6) &= 24 \\cdot 10^2 \\\\ &= 2{,}400. \\end{align*} \\]\n\nThus, D is the correct answer.",
